      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aarau",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Cantonal Library, founded after a 1803 manuscript purchase, houses a Bible annotated by Huldrych Zwingli.",
